  "resolution": "resolve the direct first-parent child of ready_anchor_parent and require that commit to carry this exact lock blob",
  "rule": "the ready anchor is the commit that carries this lock. A commit cannot contain its own hash, so it is recorded as a parent here and proved at successor time by p0_r1_ready_anchor_v3.prove, which requires HEAD == origin/main, a clean tree, executable -> anchor -> head ancestry, and every post-anchor change inside the governance allowlist."
 },
